  {
   "etapa": "explicar",
   "piezas": [
    {
     "tipo": "explicacion",
     "titulo": "deshalb: logical consequence",
     "texto": [
      "It presents the cause in the first sentence and the logical effect in the second: **Es regnet. Deshalb bleibe ich zu Hause** (It's raining. So I'm staying at home)."
     ],
     "tutora": ""
    },
    {
     "tipo": "explicacion",
     "titulo": "trotzdem: contradiction or concession",
     "texto": [
      "It presents an action that happens against expectations, relative to the first sentence: **Es regnet. Trotzdem gehe ich spazieren** (It's raining. Even so I'm going for a walk)."
     ],
     "tutora": ""
    },
    {
     "tipo": "explicacion",
     "titulo": "Syntactic position",
     "texto": [
      "Both connectors take position 1 and the conjugated verb must go in **position 2**: **Deshalb gehe ich...**, **Trotzdem mache ich...**. You never say «deshalb ich gehe»!"
     ],
     "tutora": ""
    },
